97
00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:06.190
But we don't.

98
00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:12.850
There are many different expressions
we use to describe phi implies psi.

99
00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:16.590
Some them are intuitively obvious and
