00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:35.490
Okay, that's fairly obvious.

104
00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:39.605
Two, phi is sufficient for psi.

105
00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:46.620
In order to conclude that psi,
it suffices to know phi.

106
00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:52.460
On the face of it, that's fairly
straightforward but in complicated

107
00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:57.092
situations, people can sometimes get
misled by the use of the word sufficient.

108
00:07:57.092 --> 00:08:00.013
The use of the word sufficient is by no

109
00:08:00.013 --> 00:08:04.734
means the most problematic In
