114
00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:36.848
Just as it does here.

115
00:08:36.848 --> 00:08:39.251
Let's put quotes on that one.

116
00:08:42.583 --> 00:08:45.346
The if goes with the psi,
the if goes with the psi.

117
00:08:45.346 --> 00:08:48.125
But when it's expressed in
this way with an only if,

118
00:08:48.125 --> 00:08:50.600
