128
00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:34.390
then you can ride in the Tour de France.

129
00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:36.830
I actually do have a bicycle,

130
00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:40.140
I have several, but
I can't ride in the Tour de France.

131
00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:44.226
So it's true to say, Keith could ride
