134
00:09:49.762 --> 00:09:51.220
Otherwise you can't ride in it.

135
00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:56.460
But it's not the same as
saying it this way around.

136
00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:58.910
That if you have a bicycle,
then you can ride in the Tour de France.

137
00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:01.000
So, gotta be a little bit careful.

