00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:48.080
No it doesn't.

257
00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:52.970
5 is itself a multiple of 5.

258
00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:55.450
5 is not a multiple of 10.

259
00:18:57.090 --> 00:18:57.800
Look at number two,

