266
00:19:20.572 --> 00:19:24.369
Yes, if n squared is a multiple of 100,

267
00:19:24.369 --> 00:19:28.490
does that imply that
it's a multiple of 10?

268
00:19:28.490 --> 00:19:32.940
Yes, so in this case, 2, 3, 4,
and 5 are the correct answers.

269
00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:36.194
They're all sufficient for
n being a multiple of 10.

270
00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:39.580
